Package: astraea-gnome-shell-extension
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Lwb89dev <lwb89dev@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: gnome
Priority: optional
Depends: astraea-service (= @VERSION@), gnome-shell (>= 45)
Recommends: astraea-desktop
Homepage: https://github.com/Lwb89dev/astraea
Description: Astraea agenda in the GNOME top bar
 GNOME Shell extension (GNOME 45-48) showing the Astraea agenda in the top
 bar with quick event creation. A thin D-Bus frontend: it never connects to
 Nostr relays, never holds keys and never reads the database directly.
 Enable with: gnome-extensions enable astraea@lwb89dev
